$PROBLEM    SYNTHETIC lstparsR test case s07: SAEM followed by IMP, covariance step after IMP
$INPUT      ID TIME AMT DV MDV EVID WT
$DATA      synthetic_s07.csv IGNORE=@
$SUBROUTINE ADVAN2 TRANS2
$PK
  TVCL = THETA(1) * (WT / 70)**THETA(4)
  CL   = TVCL * EXP(ETA(1))
  V    = THETA(2) * EXP(ETA(2))
  KA   = THETA(3) * EXP(ETA(3))
  S2   = V
$ERROR
  IPRED = F
  Y     = IPRED * (1 + EPS(1))
$THETA  (0, 4) (0, 30) (0, 1) 0.75
$OMEGA  0.1 0.1 0.3
$SIGMA  0.03
$ESTIMATION METHOD=SAEM INTERACTION NBURN=2000 NITER=500
$ESTIMATION METHOD=IMP INTERACTION ISAMPLE=300 NITER=50
$COVARIANCE PRINT=E
$TABLE      ID TIME IPRED CWRES NOPRINT ONEHEADER FILE=synthetic_s07.tab
  
NM-TRAN MESSAGES 
  
 WARNINGS AND ERRORS (IF ANY) FOR PROBLEM    1
             
 (WARNING  2) NM-TRAN INFERS THAT THE DATA ARE POPULATION.
  
